+                        with the scaffolding STILL ON SCREEN — a faded worked
+                        example with one step left blank, a prompt-then-confirm,
+                        a step they supply while the rest of the working stays
+                        visible. This is the MIDDLE. Write two when the fading
+                        needs a step between the complete worked example and the
+                        independent one.
